#EXTINF:625 group-title="Non Fiction Religion Other Religions",The Golden Bough Part 3 The Dying God — James Frazer · II. THE KILLING OF THE DIVINE KING. Part I. PREFERENCE FOR A VIOLENT DEATH. Human gods killed to prevent them from growing old and feeble- Preference for a violent death- the sick and old killed. - Read by Leon Harvey - Duration 00:10:25
